        <mxCell id="e40" value="worked / created" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;strokeColor=#4a5468;fontColor=#4a5468;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="app_user" target="time_entry"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e41" value="visits" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;strokeColor=#4a5468;fontColor=#4a5468;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="trip" target="trip_stop"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e42" value="is made of" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;strokeColor=#4a5468;fontColor=#4a5468;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="trip" target="trip_leg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e43" value="caused" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;fontSize=10;startArrow=ERone;startFill=0;endArrow=ERmany;endFill=0;strokeColor=#4a5468;fontColor=#4a5468;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entity" target="trip_leg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n4" value="&quot;there is only he creates or i do&quot; — 3 Sep. worked_by is paid for the hour and sets whether it bills at $80 or $130; created_by is how the row is explained later.

&quot;he is a full partner after all and can have his own clients and very much so is responsible for tracking his own time worked&quot; — 18 Aug.

[claude] client_uuid is made on the phone: the offline queue retries, and without it a retry that timed out enters the hour twice.

&quot;wouldnt it just be simpler to log hours as both which get split at partner pay out time?&quot; — 9 Sep. A team job is ONE entry carrying crew = team, so the billable quantity is stored rather than derived. If one stays on, that is a second entry at crew = one.

&quot;worked_by sounds misleading now&quot; and &quot;both should mean team&quot; — 9 Sep. worked_by is null on a team entry; created_by ran the timer; app_user.on_team says who is paid." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7b8698;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="420" width="680" height="230" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
